# Workers Static Assets: headers of the static pages (session B2 part 2). The page with the id of a scan is never
# indexed (Fedor, B2 part 2); the page also carries <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">.
/pruefung
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
/pruefung.html
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
# Session B3 part 2: the report of a real scan is never indexed, and its address (with the id) never leaves the page in
# a Referer (docs/report-schema.md, "The page of the report").
/bericht
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
/bericht.html
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
